    "voice": "produce_events/200700402/2007004020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004020050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "待ってプロデューサーお願い待って！\r\n今のはっ、なんて言うか！　違うのっ……！",
    "charAnim1": "panic",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700402/2007004020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……兄さん……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004020060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "うわぁ忘れてってば！",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700402/2007004020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやぁ、すまん。珍しかったからつい",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "用件はなんだ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004020070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "えっ……その……",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700402/2007004020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004020080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "この間のレッスンの録画、見てたら意見がほしくて……\r\nアンティーカ全員で合わせたやつ……",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700402/2007004020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、あれか",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだなぁ、他に人がいると、\r\n結華はフォローに回りがちに見えるかな",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "バランスを取ってくれるのはもちろん嬉しいし、助かる",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、もっと自分のことだけ考えて\r\nパフォーマンスをする瞬間があってもいいと思うぞ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004020090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そ、そっか……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700402/2007004020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004020100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "うーん、自分ではそこまで引いてるつもりなかったから、\r\n今度は気を付けてみるね",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700402/2007004020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、自覚するのが難しかったら……\r\n結華のファンのため、って思って動いてみるのがいいかもな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "自分のファンが一番喜ぶのはどういう見せ方だろうって、\r\n相手を具体的に想定して考えてみるんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004020110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "なるほど……",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700402/2007004020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……お兄さんとか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004020120,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "っ！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_a",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700402/2007004020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004020130,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "もうっ！　プロデューサー！\r\n三峰真面目に聞いてたのに！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700402/2007004020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004020140,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "面白がってるでしょ！？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700402/2007004020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "悪い悪い、最後だけちょっとな\r\nそれ以外は真面目なアドバイスだよ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも……",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "親しみやすさが\r\n１上がった、だな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "お兄さんっ子だったのか",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "嬉しい間違いだよ",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004020150,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "嫌だぁもう、こんなことでそのパラメーター上げたくない！",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "031",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700402/2007004020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか？　良いギャップだと思うんだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004020160,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700402/2007004020160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004020170,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "嘘ばっかり",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700402/2007004020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あれ、なんでわかるんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004020180,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "思いっきりニヤニヤしちゃってるからですよ！\r\nええ、ええ、それはもう！　わかりますとも！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700402/2007004020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004020190,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "本気でそう思ってたらそんな顔してないでしょ、\r\nプロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700402/2007004020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやでも、冗談で言ってるわけじゃないんだぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……半分くらいは",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004020200,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "この～！\r\n引っ張りすぎだよＰたんのバカ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700402/2007004020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004020210,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰、拗ねたらめんどくさいんですからねー？\r\n知らないんだから",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700402/2007004020210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお、それは困ったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004020220,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "だったら上々！　思う存分困って、\r\n三峰の機嫌を取ってくださいな、プロデューサー？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700402/2007004020220"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004020230,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "違う",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "031",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700402/2007004020230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……違うのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004020240,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "っ……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700402/2007004020240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004020250,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "別に、仲が悪いとか、そこまでではないけどね……？\r\nでも、お兄さんっ子ってほどでもないと言うか……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700402/2007004020250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004020260,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……なんかこれすごい墓穴掘ってる気がする……",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700402/2007004020260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか？",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004020270,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……いやね、なんか今度、\r\n弟も一緒にこっちまで出てくるって言うからさぁ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700402/2007004020270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004020280,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "案内した方がいいかなーとか、ちょっと考えてたわけですよ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700402/2007004020280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだったのか！　ならきちんと時間を取った方がいいな、\r\nお兄さんたち絶対喜ぶぞ",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "日取りが決まったら教えてくれ！\r\nスケジュールは調整しとくから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004020290,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あー……\r\n当日、絶対プロデューサーと出くわさないようにしよ……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700402/2007004020290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（それって、俺には会わせたくないってことだよな……！？\r\n……まだ、そこまで信用してもらえてはない、か……）",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ショックだけど……\r\nもっと近づけるように、頑張らないと……！）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
