  {
    "id": 2007004020300,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……兄さんたちになんてからかわれるか\r\nわかったもんじゃないし",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700402/2007004020300"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004020310,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "嬉しいって……Ｐたんねぇ\r\n人の間違いがそんなに面白い？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "031",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700402/2007004020310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "違うよ、そうじゃなくて",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お兄さんと呼び間違えたってことは、\r\nそれだけ事務所でリラックスできてるってことだろ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ここが結華にとって居心地のいい場所になってるなら、\r\nプロデューサーとしては嬉しい限りだなって",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004020320,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "っ……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700402/2007004020320"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004020330,
